genereti_widget_values.guide:
{
  "format": "genereti-guide",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "av-livecode",
  "title": "Livecode: sound analysis becomes visual control",
  "summary": "A quiet modular synth, RMS signal routing, spectrum/scope and an interactive p5 display.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Start sound explicitly",
      "text": "Press ▷ Start on mod.output at its low level. The lesson Play/Do it controls never unlock audio; this step waits for your own audio gesture.",
      "target": {
        "nodeType": "GeneretiAudioOutput",
        "ref": "7e66d584-d287-5e54-be4d-54f680cdb01e",
        "part": "node"
      },
      "hint": "The music clock and sequence describe notes; the output activates the browser AudioContext. Panic stops it. Queue never plays sound."
    },
    {
      "title": "Inspect the sound",
      "text": "scope shows stereo waveforms, spectrum shows frequency-bin magnitudes, and lissajous plots left against right. Display gain enlarges drawings without changing sound.",
      "target": {
        "nodeType": "GeneretiAudioSpectrum",
        "ref": "f85f6ff0-290a-5914-998c-ff2194d448c4",
        "part": "node"
      },
      "hint": "fft_size trades frequency detail for a longer analysis window. Do it sets 2048; all three taps analyze the running gain bus.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "kind": "set-widget",
          "target": {
            "nodeType": "GeneretiAudioSpectrum",
            "ref": "f85f6ff0-290a-5914-998c-ff2194d448c4",
            "widget": "fft_size",
            "part": "parameter"
          },
          "value": 2048
        },
        {
          "kind": "set-widget",
          "target": {
            "nodeType": "GeneretiAudioScope",
            "ref": "6d8a5892-a32b-539c-ad2a-dbcb76dda3b3",
            "widget": "display_gain",
            "part": "parameter"
          },
          "value": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Route RMS into p5",
      "text": "analyze.channels → chop.select rms → chop.math × 12 → energy. FLOAT is the last sample of the named control block. The p5 rings grow with sound level.",
      "target": {
        "nodeType": "GeneretiChopMath",
        "ref": "9d9d2e0f-2cc8-56cf-976e-5e1274b09610",
        "part": "node"
      },
      "hint": "This is control-rate analysis, not audio-rate DSP. energy is clamped to 0..1 in the annotated parameter. Do it restores the connection and increases sensitivity.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "kind": "set-widget",
          "target": {
            "nodeType": "GeneretiChopSelect",
            "ref": "1fc7df09-036c-5001-8b4b-dce14c820f45",
            "widget": "pattern",
            "part": "parameter"
          },
          "value": "rms"
        },
        {
          "kind": "set-widget",
          "target": {
            "nodeType": "GeneretiChopMath",
            "ref": "9d9d2e0f-2cc8-56cf-976e-5e1274b09610",
            "widget": "value",
            "part": "parameter"
          },
          "value": 18
        },
        {
          "kind": "connect",
          "source": {
            "nodeType": "GeneretiChopMath",
            "ref": "9d9d2e0f-2cc8-56cf-976e-5e1274b09610"
          },
          "target": {
            "nodeType": "GeneretiLivecode",
            "ref": "635be1ab-b538-5c16-a74f-76aa7c2890b3"
          },
          "input": "controls.value0",
          "output": "value"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Add a pointer to the performance",
      "text": "Hold and move the pointer inside the p5 output. Light spots follow your mouse while ring size follows audio. Both interactions stay live in Alt+W / Alt+O.",
      "target": {
        "nodeType": "GeneretiLivecode",
        "ref": "635be1ab-b538-5c16-a74f-76aa7c2890b3",
        "part": "preview"
      },
      "hint": "Do it changes the unconnected sensitivity parameter. The connected energy default is overridden by RMS, so changing its local widget cannot defeat the wire.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "kind": "set-widget",
          "target": {
            "nodeType": "GeneretiLivecode",
            "ref": "635be1ab-b538-5c16-a74f-76aa7c2890b3",
            "widget": "controls.value1",
            "part": "parameter"
          },
          "value": 1.5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Explore stereo and stop",
      "text": "Adjust pan to tilt the lissajous line. Mono balance is not phase modulation. Press Panic on mod.output when finished; analysis and energy return to zero.",
      "target": {
        "nodeType": "GeneretiAudioLissajous",
        "ref": "c692e22a-4ae9-5c23-996f-af3efe933de0",
        "part": "node"
      },
      "hint": "Do it only changes pan. Stop audio yourself. A future stereo effect can turn the diagonal into a loop; this demo preserves the actual channel relationship.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "kind": "set-widget",
          "target": {
            "nodeType": "GeneretiAudioGain",
            "ref": "d5f37102-1fb6-5efd-b6fc-5eaf37637596",
            "widget": "pan",
            "part": "parameter"
          },
          "value": -0.45
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

